&lt;p align=&quot;right&quot;&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Psych-Slice/P-Slice/master/#readme-top&quot;&gt;back to top&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt; 
